     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRSectionMedicalDevicePrescriptionsLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRSectionMedicalDevicePrescriptionsLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRSectionMedicalDevicePrescriptionsLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-prescription-dispositifs-medicaux.html\">CDA - FR Prescription dispositifs medicauxversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section (FRCDAPrescriptionDispositifsMedicaux)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.author[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.author (Auteur de la prescription :\n Si le prescripteur n'est pas l'auteur du document, le prescripteur doit être indiqué dans l'élément &lt;author&gt; de la section.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.codeSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.code (Code de la section)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.titleSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.title (Titre de la section)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.description</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.text (Bloc narratif de la section Prescription sous forme textuelle.)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.entry.deviceUse</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry (FRCDADispositifMedical)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html\">FR Composition Documentversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section (FRCompositionDocument.section:sectionMedicalDevicePrescription)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.author[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.author (Who and/or what authored the section)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.codeSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.code (Classification of section (recommended))</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.titleSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.title (Label for section (e.g. for ToC))</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.description</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.text (Text summary of the section, for human interpretation)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedicalDevicePrescriptions.entry.deviceUse</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.entry (FRDeviceUseStatementDocument)</td></tr></table></div>"
